tivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Closed in well. Meanwhile held prejob meeting with all personnel involved regarding RU BHA, install plug and RD WL equipment.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2010-09-18T20:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2010-09-18T23:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Took over controll of HMV and DHSV. Opened WL BOP. Installed BHA#2 into lubricator. Added 50 litres of Ramex into riser. Leak tested rig up. 20/170 bar for 5/10 min. Pumped totally 700 litres. Opened well. WHP = 97.5 bar.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2010-09-18T23:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2010-09-18T23:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">490</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- wire line</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH with BHA#2, EVO plug on tractor. Stopped into DHSV. Attempted several times to pass. Neg.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2010-09-18T23:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2010-09-19T00:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">490</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- wire line</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Started to equalize DHSV by pumping MEG into well.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
